# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local (for local development)
# 2. Copy this file to .env (for Vercel deployment - add via Vercel dashboard)
# 3. Replace the placeholder values with your actual credentials
# 4. Never commit .env or .env.local files to Git!
